To publish (topic, payload):
1. Call each function in bus.subscribers[topic], one at a time, with just payload.
2. Then call each wildcard function for the topic "*", one at a time, with (topic, payload).
3. If a function fails, ignore it. Other functions still run.
4. If no functions ran successfully, add (topic, payload) to bus.dead_letters.
5. Return the number of functions that ran without error.

